sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration: none;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n              红宝石庄园Finca El Rubí是由Heiner Lasso的父母Segundo Lazo and Stella Ojeda于1995年购置的，种植面积4公顷；Heiner是高中毕业后就直接开始了农场的工作，开始学习和协助管理农场的事务；\n             </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Gr457cyFia7RF1Mguwzzkku5bg8Y0s7qRobXON4icdyOQEGgyebWmG5UOPp8SQCNKHR0Yiakuu6Czto5ibZs1UhicSw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n             农场最初种植了5000棵卡杜拉，直到2003年产量都很稳定；但是随着叶锈病的侵袭，Heiner的父亲出于担心将咖啡树开始全部更换为据称更为抗锈病的Castillo，但是不幸的是随后赶上产量很低同时咖啡的价格又很低迷的一个产季，这些让Heiner都反思觉得这样的种植经营方式不是个长远之计，于是他去报名了SENA的咖啡培训课程，学习加工处理和病虫害防控；学成回来后，他决定再一次更换种植的咖啡品种，这一次他选择了瑰夏，粉波旁，SL28和Sidra等，这一次，他压对了，他的成功也让附近的咖农们看到了方向，也因此影响了这个区域的很多咖农，甚至现在Acevedo的整体种植品种和加工处理水平都很高也是因为有很多像Heiner的年轻一代咖农的种植意识的转变而来；\n            </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RF1Mguwzzkku5bg8Y0s7qRxLwviag3mqyCHQzhZAn5vYWyUgr4bnbib9TtelqMUgHrxbRHeqk59hhQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n               关于本批次处理\n              </span>\n</span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 1.5em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;list-style-type: circle;\">\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 1