0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n                     这只瑰夏的处理过程相对复杂一些，处理过程简要：\n                    </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       鲜果采收，筛选\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       鲜果发酵，在Grainpro塑料袋中，80小时\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       去果皮，使用之前收集的SL28品种的咖啡发酵液浸泡发酵120小时\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;\">\n<span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n                       晒床晾晒\n                      </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n                  ‍‍\n                 </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n              公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n              客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;line-height: 1.75em;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;font-size: 14px;\">\n<span>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZfP6JRomfrYRJyo2D4Tf0NvibBUZu9UP4VMYvReaLlu6bc42JoO24QdA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);font-style: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: auto;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: auto;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-